#: view.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<h3>Rules of Game</h3><p>Your goal is to assemble lines of at least three "
"similar diamonds. Click on two adjacent diamonds to swap them.</p><p>Earn "
"extra points by building cascades, and extra seconds by assembling big lines "
"or multiple lines at one time.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Regles del xuegu</h3><p>La to meta ye axuntar polo menos tres diamantes "
"similares. Primi en dos diamantes soxacentes pa intercambialos.</p> <p>Gana "
"puntos estra construyendo cascaes y axuntando llinies grandes o munches "
"d'elles al mesmu tiempu.</p>"
